Third-party material
--------------------

This package includes Earth imagery from NASA: Blue Marble: Next Generation
(earth-day-*.jpg), the NASA Earth Observatory cloud composite
(earth-clouds-2048.jpg) and NASA Visible Earth GEBCO elevation
(earth-topology.png). NASA imagery is in the public domain.

This package includes 1:50m vector data from Natural Earth
(https://www.naturalearthdata.com/): countries, coastlines, borders and
capitals, in the public domain. Translated country and capital names come from
Natural Earth and Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org/) labels, available under
CC0 1.0. The normal and specular maps are derived from these files.

The package stylesheet (dist/globe.css) is compiled with Tailwind CSS
(https://tailwindcss.com), Copyright Tailwind Labs, Inc., licensed under the
MIT License. The license banner is kept at the top of the file.

This package is designed to be used with three.js (https://threejs.org),
Copyright three.js authors, licensed under the MIT License. three.js (`three`)
is a peer dependency and is not bundled.
